mailcopilot-public-mirror-snapshot

This tree is a published snapshot of the MailCopilot source, produced by the
mirror export pipeline. Internal-only files (CI plumbing, planning documents,
agent instructions) are stripped from it by design — their absence is
intentional, and this file is what declares it.

The content is intentionally static; see MIRROR_EXPORT_MARKER in
scripts/check-mirror-exclude.mjs.
